
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

    <title>Pesanan Berhasil - Bakery Marketplace</title>

    <style>
        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
        }

        body {
            margin: 0;
            min-height: 100vh;
            background: #fdf8f5;
            color: #4a2c18;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        .success-container {
            background: white;
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 520px;
            padding: 40px;
            border-radius: 18px;
            text-align: center;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);
        }

        .success-icon {
            width: 85px;
            height: 85px;
            margin: 0 auto 20px;
            background: #e7f7eb;
            color: #26964a;
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 42px;
        }

        h1 {
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            font-size: 1.8rem;
        }

        .description {
            color: #8a7669;
            line-height: 1.6;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
        }

        .order-card {
            background: #faf3ee;
            border: 1px dashed #d9c8be;
            padding: 22px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            margin: 25px 0;
            text-align: left;
        }

        .order-row {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            gap: 15px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
        }

        .order-row:last-child {
            margin-bottom: 0;
        }

        .order-label {
            color: #8a7669;
        }

        .order-value {
            font-weight: 600;
            text-align: right;
        }

        .status {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 7px 12px;
            background: #fff0d9;
            color: #b86b35;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        .total {
            border-top: 1px solid #e5d5cc;
            padding-top: 15px;
            margin-top: 15px;
        }

        .total .order-value {
            color: #b86b35;
            font-size: 1.2rem;
        }

        .info {
            background: #f4f8ff;
            color: #49648a;
            padding: 14px;
            border-radius: 9px;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            line-height: 1.5;
            text-align: left;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
        }

        .button {
            display: block;
            width: 100%;
            padding: 14px;
            background: #b86b35;
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 9px;
            font-weight: 700;
            transition: background 0.2s;
        }

        .button:hover {
            background: #945128;
        }

        .secondary-link {
            display: inline-block;
            margin-top: 18px;
            color: #b86b35;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        @media (max-width: 480px) {
            .success-container {
                padding: 25px 20px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="success-container">

    <div class="success-icon">
        ✓
    </div>

    <h1>Pesanan Berhasil Dibuat!</h1>

    <p class="description">
        Terima kasih sudah berbelanja.
        Pesanan kamu berhasil dikirim kepada penjual
        dan sedang menunggu konfirmasi.
    </p>

    <div class="order-card">

        <div class="order-row">
            <span class="order-label">Nomor Pesanan</span>
            <span class="order-value">#<%= order.id %></span>
        </div>

        <div class="order-row">
            <span class="order-label">Nama Toko</span>
            <span class="order-value"><%= store.nama_toko %></span>
        </div>

        <div class="order-row">
            <span class="order-label">Status</span>
            <span class="status">Menunggu Konfirmasi</span>
        </div>

        <div class="order-row total">
            <span class="order-label">Total Pembayaran</span>
            <span class="order-value">
                Rp <%= Number(order.totalHarga).toLocaleString('id-ID') %>
            </span>
        </div>

    </div>

    <div class="info">
        <strong>Informasi:</strong><br>
        Pesanan kamu akan diproses setelah penjual
        menerima dan mengonfirmasi pesanan.
        Silakan pantau status pesanan melalui dashboard.
    </div>

    <a href="/dashboard" class="button">
        Kembali ke Dashboard
    </a>

    <a href="/toko/<%= store.id %>" class="secondary-link">
        Kembali ke Toko
    </a>

</div>

</body>
</html>
